        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Online Auction on Thursday the 12th November at 3.00pm\n\nThe property comprises of a derelict Farmhouse and Sheds on C. 15.5 acres of land. \n\nWhile the Farmhouse is in need of complete refurbishment, it represents an opportunity for a purchaser to restore this property to its former glory. \nThe generous site also allows for ample opportunities for extending the property or indeed a bit of hobby farming! \n\nIdeal project as a doer upper. Services: mains water connected, septic tank and electricity is disconnected. \nThe property comprises of living area, sitting room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and a bathroom. \n\nSituated to the rear of the farmhouse is a 3 bay single slatted shed, 3 bay hayshed \nand some old storage sheds. \n\nThe lands C. 15.5 acres (6.29 hectares) are of average quality and are contained in Part Folio LM23781F are set out in one convenient block. \nFrom the land there are views of Belhavel Lake and the surrounding countryside. There is a river that borders all the land and a also well situated at the bottom of the land beside the river.\n\nThe farmhouse should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant Scheme (subject to terms conditions - check government websites for further details under vacant property refurbishment grants) \n\nLegal: Matthew Brown Solr, Kelly Ryan LLP Solrs , Manorhamilton.\n\nONLINE AUCTION REGISTRATION: All intending online bidders must register at dmauctions.marteye.ie and contact DM Auctions, Manorhamilton to organise their registration. A deposit of ?10,000 is payable in order to be accepted to bid on the day of Auction by Monday the 9th of November 2026. Email leitrim@dmauctions.ie or call 071 9856444 to register or for further details.\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nLiving Room\n4.28m x 3.92m\n\nSitting Room\n4.04m x 3.96m\n\nKitchen\n2.63m x 1.71m\n\nBedroom 1\n4.17m x 3.68m\n\nBedroom 2\n3.97m x 3.00m\n\nBathroom\n3.13m x 1.94m\n\n"
      },
